OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 22 MAR
OL,4,G1330FMusic Map
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch explores the
OL,6,     Gvernal landscape that surrounds
OL,7,     GDelius' joyous ode to spring,
OL,8,     Gincluding Beethoven's own
OL,9,     G'Pastoral' and Takemitsu's Tokyo
OL,10,     Gcherry blossom.
OL,11,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,12,     GFrom St Michael's Church, Barnes,
OL,13,     GLondon, with the choir of Tiffin
OL,14,     GSchool and music by Oliver Tarney
OL,15,     Gand Howells.
OL,16,G1600FJazz Record Requests
OL,17,     GAlyn presents jazz records of all
OL,18,     Gstyles as requested by you,
OL,19,     Gincluding music from saxophonists
OL,20,     GMelissa Aldanni & Chris Potter,
OL,21,     Gvocalists Betty Bennett & Nancy
OL,22,     GWilson & Frank Zappa.
