OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 22 MAR
OL,4,G1915FBetween the Ears: Elephant Voices
OL,5,     GAn evocative sonic journey into
OL,6,     Gthe lives of elephants through
OL,7,     Gthe work of expert Joyce Poole,
OL,8,     Gdrawing on her Elephant Ethogram
OL,9,     G- a remarkable online archive of
OL,10,     Gelephant calls.
OL,11,G1945FSunday Feature: New Generation
OL,12,     FThinkers
OL,13,     GSophie Oliver guides us inside
OL,14,     Gthe remarkable home of Gertrude
OL,15,     GStein and Alice Toklas in Paris
OL,16,     Gand focuses on the material
OL,17,     Gobjects they cherished as a
OL,18,     Gwindow onto their world.
